  "details": "I suggest having the ability to rearrange images, move things around, create categories, forms, and more inside of the group page of a group\n\n# How\n\nthis could be done like a website maker, something like changing the color of the group page or setting it up to have images in the group info or in multiple pages, instead of just the gallery. this would be tremendously more appealing to new users, and it would improve engagement and/or show which group is more well-kept and which is just \"made just to be there\".\n\n# Legit Feel\n\nmore images and custom graphics would help any group feel more \"legit\" and more official than the current setup, don't you think that a group with hundreds of custom images and banners is more appealing than a group that just has a banner and the default color?",
